{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25992","headline":"旧镜 · 鲍溶","name":"旧镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"婵娟本家镜，与妾归君子。\n每忆并照时，相逢明月里。\n春风忽分影，白日难依倚。\n珠粉不结花，玉璫宁辉耳。\n心期不可见，不保长如此。\n华发一欺人，青铜化爲鬼。\n良人有归日，肯学妖桃李。\n瑶匣若浮云，冥冥藏玉水。\n侍儿不遣照，恐学孤鸾死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}